{"ID":"20240513083047-7tlhybi","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083047-7tlhybi","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083047-7tlhybi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513165354-ih9fvrl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513165354-ih9fvrl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513165354-ih9fvrl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:477,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:477\u0026#125;","title":"261","type":"doc","updated":"20240515115718"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513165354-ih9fvrl","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 811px;","id":"20240513165354-ih9fvrl","updated":"20240515115718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/05/12"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"203 L, CY"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Male"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"44歲 身材一般"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/12"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"後項及右背有一腫瘤（脂肪瘤），輕微痔瘡痔漏，膀胱無力，視力有問題"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1、 痔瘡不會痛，便後擦屁股時有血，痔漏是肛門口外突出一塊"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、 口渴，喜喝冰水，但喝一點水就想上廁所，感覺膀胱無力，頻尿"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、 睡覺時腳一開始是熱的，但後來是冷的，便會縮進棉被中"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、 大便：容易腹瀉"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、 左眼遠視弱視，右眼近視"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：\n2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右眼腎區大，腎陽不"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→陽虛時陰會變大，水會反侮到土，所以容易腹瀉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 消渴（桂附八味丸症）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→腎陽不足故飲一溲一"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：\nHT31："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一斤，早餐及晚餐後各40顆"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" → 脂肪瘤，燃燒三焦脂肪"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"HT48："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一斤，早餐及晚餐前各40顆 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 即桂附八味丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"HT29："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中餐及睡前各30顆 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 消痔丸，消外痔"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 男人的背為陽，腹為陰；女人胸為陽，所以奶水是白色。若水面上的浮屍背朝上的為男人，胸朝上則為女人。病在陽易治。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 血糖高的人要多運動，嚴格控制血糖反而死亡率更高，一吃降血糖藥，腳就冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 飲一溲一並且容易腹瀉為桂附八味丸症，六味地黃丸大部分是足後跟痛，吃桂附八味丸可使腹瀉改善但痔瘡更壞，所以便秘的人不要吃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}